coordinates geometry.xyz
run energy
cis yes
basis def2-svpd
method wb97xd3
charge -2
spinmult 1
pointcharges mm_charges.dat
pointcharges_self_interaction no
scrdir scr_super
# The supermolecular splitting at frame 1832 is 0.006 eV. Mixed
# precision and the default grid are nowhere near that, so both are
# forced here; these settings are the reason the test is meaningful.
precision double
dftgrid 4
threall 1.0e-14
# 1.0e-6, not tighter. The SCF plateaus at a DIIS error of ~1e-6 with diffuse
# functions on a net -2 system and will otherwise grind to maxit. At the plateau
# the total energy is stable to ~1e-8 Ha = 2.7e-7 eV, four orders of magnitude
# below the 0.006 eV splitting being measured, and systematic error largely
# cancels in the root-to-root difference that is the actual observable.
convthre 1.0e-6
cisalgorithm davidson
cisnumstates 30
cisguessvecs 60
cismax 1000
cismaxiter 500
cisconvtol 1.0e-7
cistarget 1
scf diis+a
gpus 1
end
